finetune_heldout fixture (cookbook/fixtures/finetune_heldout/)

This directory redistributes derived text from the Open Graph Benchmark
"ogbn-arxiv" dataset: `heldout_pairs.jsonl` and `train_ids_sha256.json`
carry title+abstract-derived text (clipped to 1500 characters) for a
128+1372-pair same-subject supervision split mined from the committed
4000-paper ogbn-arxiv subset (see `arxiv_subset_ids.txt`, `manifest.json`).

